{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s nothing here but you in an endless, silent emptiness. Well, almost nothing. Glowing platforms light the dark, offering the only path forward. This is the void, and it won't let you escape until you reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Void</strong> is a first-person platformer game\u2014a test of nerve, patience and muscle memory where the world itself is the puzzle. Platforms will rotate, move, or disappear entirely. Gravity will be your enemy, and the very path you once walked might be in your way once again. You are desperate for a single glimmer of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light is the only way out. Do you have the will to reach it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951450?t=1757020166","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951450/bbeb6caf02e42a12c820f47e3093430c92dcbd1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757020166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951450/bf9a61a736f91cc8baad6e1276e60a3307c4169a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757020166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951450/bf9a61a736f91cc8baad6e1276e60a3307c4169a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757020166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s nothing here but you in an endless, silent emptiness. Well, almost nothing. Glowing platforms light the dark, offering the